notes.content:
Changes in v0.9.11:
[list]
[*] Option to set anti aliasing;
[*] Some UI improvements;
[*] Increased compatibility with 144Hz monitors;
[*] Better car identification on night mode;
[/list]

Bug fixes:
[list]
[*] Most of controllers issues solved;
[/list]

Changes in v0.9.10:
[list]
[*] Improvements on controllers detection;
[*] Marbles challenge are now present on last 2 bedroom tracks;
[/list]



Bug fixes:
[list]
[*] It's not possible anymore to reverse before race starts;
[*] Blank pages on menu after finishing a race solved;
[/list]

Changes in v0.9.8:
[list]
[*] Added 2 more soundtracks;
[*] Respawn on top of other players and objects improved;
[*] Collision physics between cars improved;
[*] Impact SFX are now smaller.
[/list]

"My little brother spread some sticky things on the tracks. Be careful!"

Changes in v0.9.7:
[list]
[*] Graphics and lightning improvements to fix performance issues;
[*] Depth of field implemented. Note that it impacts performance and can be disabled on settings page;
[*] Menu scenery updated;
[*] Stick substances spread in almost all tracks;
[*] The hammering toy is now a mini challenge;
[*] Skidmarks are now present when reversing.
[/list]

Bug fixes:
[list]
[*]Cars are not faster when reversing anymore.
[/list]

"After talking a lot, mom and dad decided to renew our ugly kitchen and do some improvements in my bedroom. It's so much cooler to race with our tiny little cars in them right now!"

We really want to thank again all the players that are really engaged in supporting the game with precious feedback! The game is becoming so much better with all the suggestions you are giving to us!

Changes in version 0.9.6:
[list]
[*] Kitchen and bedroom sceneries were improved;
[*] Top down camera is now the default setting;
[*] Bug that new players start with muted volume fixed;
[*] Adjustment on some impact effects that were very repetitive.
[/list]

This is a very important update because it's all based on community feedback:
[list]
[*] Player re-spawn on top of other players and objects improved;
[*] CPU cars health implemented;
[*] Player health is not affected by collision with other cars anymore;
[*] Balls on bedroom tracks are smaller, translucent, and don't affect player health before race starts;
[*] Visual cue for low health implemented (still needs tweaking).
[/list]

This update covers the following:
[list]
[*] Visible area in front of cars on chase camera was increased;
[*] From now on, in multiplayer coop mode, the team that scores is the one with last car alive;
[*] In each track, the players' car models and performance in free for all matches are now the same from missions;
[*] Overall improvements on textures quality;
[*] Now it's harder for players to lose control after a collision;
[*] Some improvements on UI.
[/list]

In this update we implemented a chase camera, more dynamic but less nauseating than the previous top down with tilting. A straight top down cam (with no tilting) is still available, for those who prefer, through the settings page. Please feel free to post impressions here:

https://steamcommunity.com/app/1234620/discussions/0/2146469724190151955/

Other changes:
[list]
[*] Several changes / fixes on sound department;
[*] Screen shakes are less frequent;
[*] Popcorn and skidmarks shaders fixed on dark model tracks;
[*] CPU opponents has more probability to lose control after a hit;
[/list]

This update is focused on controllers:
[list]
[*] The auto acceleration will be forced enabled when 3 or more players are playing on keyboard. For all other cases, it will be disabled;
[*] Some keys on keyboard were reassigned to improve multiplayer experience;
[*] Tips were implemented;
[*] Some leaderboard bugs were solved.
[/list]
Note: this update was anticipated because it was impacting many players. Please expect a bigger update on Apr, 1st.

A big update this time!
[list]
[*] Kitchen tracks released!
[*] Down button now works as brakes and reverse;
[*] Auto acceleration must be enabled when playing with 3 players or more, due to maximum simultaneous keyboard input; 
[*] Improvements on menu graphics and navigation;
[*] Improvements on score board and game over graphics;
[*] Improvements on music synchronization;
[/list]

Update with minor improvements:
[list]
[*] Auto acceleration now can be enabled / disabled on settings menu (keys for players 3 and 4 were changed);
[*] Dpad input is now working for Xbox controller;
[/list]
